<title>CHINA: China 1996 tin exports slip 16.5 pct yr-on-yr.</title>
<headline>China 1996 tin exports slip 16.5 pct yr-on-yr.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's exports of unwrought tin and tin alloys fell to 36,158 tonnes in 1996, down by 16.5 percent compared with 1995, customs figures showed on Thursday.</p>
<p>Tin exports were 3,978 tonnes in December alone.</p>
<p>China exported 43,307 tonnes of tin in 1995, the figures showed.</p>
</text>
